# Normalize line endings in the object store.
#
# This repository grew a mixed history: most files are stored with LF but ten
# were committed from Windows with CRLF. With core.autocrlf=true the working
# tree is uniformly CRLF regardless, so git wants to rewrite whichever set does
# not match on every commit, turning one-line edits into whole-file diffs.
#
# text=auto stores everything as LF and checks it out in the platform's native
# form. The commit that adds this file also renormalizes the ten stragglers, so
# from here on the two stay in agreement.
* text=auto

# Never touch these, in case auto-detection guesses wrong.
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.ico binary
*.psd binary
*.svg text
